  partName: Shaft
  description: The Electrical Harness is a complex network of wires and pipes situated
    at the middle-center-center of the jet engine, with a large size that accommodates
    the various electrical systems. It distributes electrical power to critical engine
    components, such as fuel pumps and ignition systems, making it essential for
    engine operation. Notably, the Electrical Harness's complex shape is designed
    to withstand the harsh environmental conditions within the engine, including
    high temperatures and vibrations.
